    "detailed_description": "This is an action adventure 2D platforming pixel art game, inspired by dark souls. Fight bosses and gain new abilities in order to cleanse the corruption from the land!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- gameplay has some elements from the souls series, such as dodge rolling, stamina and mana bars as well as boss fights. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- movement controls are like a standard 2D platformer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- different abilities are acquired and can be used<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- game has different zones that you can progress to once you have beaten the boss of the area (similar to dark souls)",
